# Wave T37 (Craterlake kit): craterfloor — Craterlake City's
# registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the
# -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). WHITE
# CRATER SETT: rough white crater-stone setts in a tight dark
# ash grout grid, grey ash drifted into the joints and flecked
# across the faces — the painting's white ring streets. A
# rough small-block white sett is structurally unlike
# Lastlight's smooth veined marble slabs, Cragmoor's dark
# basalt sett (the same grammar in black) and Blossom's large
# inlay slabs. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T37-CRATERLAKE-PLAN.md.)
